  <p id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">明帝陳貴妃諱<persName id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p001:m0006" ref="989_en9_fv0_A">妙登</persName>，丹陽建康人，屠家女也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">尋又迎還，生<persName id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p002:m0006" ref="91d_607_b0a">廢帝</persName>，故民中皆呼<persName id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p002:m0014" ref="91d_607_b0a">廢帝</persName>為李氏子。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">追贈太妃父<persName id="c-songshu-041-dinglingguang-chen-rank:p003:m0005" ref="989_en9_fv0">金寶</persName>散騎常侍</p>
</text>
